                <note rend="inline" type="source">821.51/2526: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Colombia</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Braden</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bogotá</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1940-07-15T19:00:00-05:00">July 15, 1940—7
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 10:14 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>192. My telegram No. 172, June 26, 2 p.m. Interpretation now is special powers
                    expire midnight July 19.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Braden</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
